<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ADVANTA CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Advanta</p>
<p>Championship women's tennis tournament Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) beat 8-Barbara Paulus</p>
<p>(Austria) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 5-7 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
